#. a month, short, in the day a game's saves were kept (Kept 3 Oct 2026).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7990
msgid "Jan"
msgstr "يناير"

#. a month, short, in the day a game's saves were kept (Kept 3 Oct 2026).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7990
msgid "Feb"
msgstr "فبراير"

#. a month, short, in the day a game's saves were kept (Kept 3 Oct 2026).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7990
msgid "Mar"
msgstr "مارس"

#. a month, short, in the day a game's saves were kept (Kept 3 Oct 2026).
